{"channelId":"UCspTSqbjFHwbJPuW1_xkJLw","row":["Tracy’s Paws Rescue",3960,"Welcome to Tracy's Paws Rescue where every rescue has a story, and every dog deserves a second chance. ❤️🐾\n\nWe rescue abandoned, neglected, abused, and homeless dogs throughout Texas, providing the medical care, rehabilitation, and love they need before helping them find safe, forever homes.\n\nOn this channel, you'll discover:\n\n🐶 Rescue dog transformations\n🐾 Rescue puppies and newborn litters\n❤️ Adoption success stories\n🏡 Dogs available for adoption\n🚑 Medical rescue journeys and recoveries\n🎥 Behind-the-scenes rescue missions\n📚 Dog care, rescue education, and advocacy\n\nEvery like, comment, share, and subscription helps us reach more people, find more forever families, and save even more lives.\n\nWhether you're looking to adopt, foster, volunteer, donate, or simply follow inspiring rescue stories, you're part of this mission.\n\n❤️ Subscribe today and help us give every dog the loving home they deserve.\n\n🏡 Adopt • Foster • Volunteer • Donate\n\nBecause every dog deserves a second chance.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCspTSqbjFHwbJPuW1_xkJLw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCspTSqbjFHwbJPuW1_xkJLw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:52.335Z","channelId":"UCspTSqbjFHwbJPuW1_xkJLw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"b34bf97cdeb9a969ee2fb00ae76f796980a4f487e8df97c8be93fe1251669a6b","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"d3f75cd2c7c7cdf5772a5119e5c5b1c2fea92cb489c1e09f1754f89f0792ee5e"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCspTSqbjFHwbJPuW1_xkJLw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":3960,"raw":"3.96K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCspTSqbjFHwbJPuW1_xkJLw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:52.335Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"qual